<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  com.stevenshearrill.mac-sync-export.plist — TEMPLATE (R6, 2026-09-24). Runs `mac-sync.sh export`, with
  the push flag on, once a day at 03:00 local time: after most of the day's real installs/changes, before
  the OTHER Mac's next `pull` (every 30 min) would see it. That push flag is deliberate here, and ONLY here
  — a bare `mac-sync.sh export` run by hand never pushes on its own; see integrations/mac-sync/README.md.

  A single launchd job cannot run on two different cadences, so this is a SECOND, separate LaunchAgent next
  to com.stevenshearrill.mac-sync-pull.plist — not one job trying to do both.

  BEFORE loading this file, on THIS Mac (same three substitutions as the pull template):
    1. mkdir -p ~/Library/Logs/mac-sync ~/Library/LaunchAgents
    2. cp integrations/mac-sync/com.stevenshearrill.mac-sync-export.plist \
         ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.stevenshearrill.mac-sync-export.plist
    3. sed -i '' "s#__REPO_DIR__#$(pwd)#g; s#__HOME__#$HOME#g" ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.stevenshearrill.mac-sync-export.plist
       (run that from the repo root — __REPO_DIR__ becomes THIS Mac's real checkout path)
    4. launchctl load ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.stevenshearrill.mac-sync-export.plist

  Expect: at the next 03:00 local (or right away — RunAtLoad is on, so loading it also fires one
  immediately), ~/Library/Logs/mac-sync/export.log ends with either "pushed" or a line starting
  "mac-sync export: push FAILED" (network/credential — check by hand, nothing was lost, it stays committed
  locally and the next successful run or a manual 'git push' still carries it).
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <key>Label</key>
  <string>com.stevenshearrill.mac-sync-export</string>
  <key>ProgramArguments</key>
  <array>
    <string>/bin/bash</string>
    <string>__REPO_DIR__/integrations/mac-sync/mac-sync.sh</string>
    <string>export</string>
    <string>--push</string>
  </array>
  <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
  <string>__REPO_DIR__</string>
  <key>StartCalendarInterval</key>
  <dict>
    <key>Hour</key>
    <integer>3</integer>
    <key>Minute</key>
    <integer>0</integer>
  </dict>
  <key>RunAtLoad</key>
  <true/>
  <key>StandardOutPath</key>
  <string>__HOME__/Library/Logs/mac-sync/export.log</string>
  <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
  <string>__HOME__/Library/Logs/mac-sync/export.log</string>
  <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
  <dict>
    <key>PATH</key>
    <string>__HOME__/.npm-global/bin:/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin</string>
    <key>HOME</key>
    <string>__HOME__</string>
  </dict>
</dict>
</plist>
